{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Text Lookup reads selected text or text under the pointer only when triggered. Captured text stays in the current popup unless you create a FlashDict card. It does not use Screen Recording or keep lookup history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本取词仅在触发时读取选区或鼠标指针下的文字。捕获内容只保留在当前弹窗中，除非你明确创建 FlashDict 闪卡；不会使用屏幕录制权限，也不会保存查词历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window Management uses Accessibility only to move and resize the frontmost application window. Text Lookup has separate controls and privacy behavior above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口管理仅使用辅助功能移动和缩放前台应用窗口。文本取词使用上方独立的控制和隐私规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Lookup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本取词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Text Lookup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用文本取词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selection Trigger": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "划词触发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动弹出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcut Required": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要快捷键确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lookup Shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取词快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-tap ⌥": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双击 ⌥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipboard Compatibility Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪贴板兼容取词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Accessibility cannot read an existing selection, ZBox may briefly simulate Copy and restore the clipboard if it has not changed. Pointer lookup never uses the clipboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当辅助功能无法读取已有选区时，ZBox 可短暂模拟复制，并仅在剪贴板未被改动时恢复内容。鼠标指针取词不会使用剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译目标语言"
          }
